{"id":"n42877-1-7","stage":4,"title":"노여움 · 怒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42877-1-7-1","ko":"이제 너는 얼굴도 보기 싫으니 어서 나가라.","zh":"我现在连你的脸都不想看了，快出去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴도","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴도","audio":"/audio/87178fcadbbffb4739aa.mp3"}},{"text":"보기","meaning":"看，看待","explanation":"보다：看，看待；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"4","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보기","audio":"/audio/ac5b575fff0fa0654941.mp3"}},{"text":"싫으니","meaning":"不愿意，不想","explanation":"싫다：不愿意，不想；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"2","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싫으니","audio":"/audio/dcae888f0da05e9ee6f7.mp3"}},{"text":"어서","meaning":"快","explanation":"어서：快。","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"1","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}},{"text":"나가라.","meaning":"离开","explanation":"나가다：离开；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"10","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가라","audio":"/audio/51578270465e19fc175a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，看待","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"认识并判断事件或情况。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"不愿意，不想","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不情愿做某事。","pronunciation":["실타"]},{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于催促做事或行动。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"离开","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间，或曾所属的地方出去。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/82aa59f1330749137aee.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42877-1-7-2","ko":"어머니, 제가 정말 잘못했어요. 노여움을 푸세요.","zh":"妈妈，我真的错了。请消气吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니,","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못했어요.","meaning":"做错，做得不好","explanation":"잘못하다：做错，做得不好；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못했어요","audio":"/audio/e5b11f3183d57de1c37a.mp3"}},{"text":"노여움을","meaning":"怒，怒气，恼","explanation":"노여움：怒，怒气，恼；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노여움","audio":"/audio/a0173c619fc6f12ba264.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42877","senseId":"1","lemma":"노여움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노여움을","audio":"/audio/6c6ac86bce2c6ad3508d.mp3"}},{"text":"푸세요.","meaning":"消气、平息怒火","explanation":"풀다：消解怒气；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"풀다","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29761","senseId":"3","lemma":"풀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"푸세요","audio":"/audio/fb11758ed30fff5786c1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"c088e8817916a36c","term":"잘못하다","zh":"做错，做得不好","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3","entryId":"69936","definition":"做得有错或不对。","pronunciation":["잘모타다"]},{"id":"a0173c619fc6f12b","term":"노여움","zh":"怒，怒气，恼","audio":"/audio/a0173c619fc6f12ba264.mp3","entryId":"42877","definition":"很不愉快而生气的感情。","pronunciation":["노ː여움"]},{"id":"cada9014a11f228c","term":"풀다","zh":"消解怒气","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3","entryId":"29761","definition":"消解怒气","pronunciation":["풀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/68293a4c7258b6eafdeb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.757,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42877","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5837,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我现在连你的脸都不想看了，快出去吧。","妈妈，我真的错了。请消气吧。","这次社团野餐会在哪儿举行啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我现在连你的脸都不想看了，快出去吧。","妈妈，我真的错了。请消气吧。","这次社团野餐会在哪儿举行啊？"],"answer":1}]}
